---
/**
 * Blockquote replacement inside blog MDX. Square, no radius — a border-left
 * in the accent colour and a substrate plate, matching the site's one-hue,
 * no-shadow system rather than a generic quote block.
 */
---

<blockquote class="my-8 border-l-4 border-moss bg-substrate px-6 py-5 text-lead text-pretty text-ink-soft">
  <slot />
</blockquote>
